-4-5. "Mark items as complete/un-mark items as complete" — `cy.find()` on detached list item
+**Defect B — removeChild race on Enter + blur:** Enter keydown on empty edit calls `saveEdit` -> `render()`. Enter default action fires `blur` synchronously, re-entering `saveEdit` -> `render()`. Second render removes the stale `<li>`, then first render's `removeChild` fails because node already detached.
 
-**Failures 6-8 (removeChild during editing):** `saveEdit()` calls `render()` which removes and recreates the editing `<li>` while the blur event handler is still in flight. The blur handler's `removeChild` then fails because the node was already removed from the DOM.
